  "description": "Juwon, a flashy social butterfly, and Hangyeol, a blunt and quiet loner.  \nThe two of them had been living double lives, hiding their hidden pain—until they unexpectedly ran into each other at the hospital, revealing sides of themselves no one else knew.  \nThey become each other's only comfort.\n\nNow that their secrets are out, they form an unlikely \"caregiver alliance.\"  \nA campus life filled with double lives, secret caregiving, and a bond that grows in the most unexpected places!\n\n_Source: NAVER Series, translated_",
